sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant BS as Booking Service
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant PS as Provider Service
    participant PY as Payment Service
    participant NS as Notification Service
    Client->>BS: PATCH /api/bookings/42/cancel
    BS->>BS: Statut = CANCELLED + historique
    BS-->>Client: 200 OK
    BS->>MQ: BookingCancelled
    MQ-->>PS: BookingCancelled
    PS->>PS: Libérer le créneau
    MQ-->>PY: BookingCancelled
    PY->>PY: Examiner le remboursement
    PY->>MQ: PaymentRefunded
    MQ-->>NS: PaymentRefunded
    NS->>NS: Créer la notification du client
